{"title":"Contribute","description":"","article":"\n    <h1>Contribution guidelines</h1>\n<p>Thanks for taking a look at how to contribute to Stirling PDFs open-source codebase!</p>\n<h2 id=\"development-setup\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Development Setup<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#development-setup\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><h3 id=\"prerequisites\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Prerequisites<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#prerequisites\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h3><ul>\n<li>Java 25 (JDK 25)</li>\n<li>Node.js compatible with the locked tooling: Node 20.19+, 22.13+ or 24+ (Node 18 is unsupported)</li>\n<li>Docker (for testing)</li>\n<li>Gradle (included in repository)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"getting-started\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Getting Started<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#getting-started\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h3><ol>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Clone the repository</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Stirling-PDF</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Install dependencies</strong></p>\n<p>The repository uses <a href=\"https://taskfile.dev/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Task</a> as a unified command runner. Install the <code>task</code> CLI, then from the repository root:</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">task</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Backend Development</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Build and run the Spring Boot backend</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">task</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> backend:dev</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Backend runs on localhost:8080</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Frontend Development (V2.0+)</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Start the Vite dev server (run from the repository root)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">task</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> frontend:dev</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Frontend runs on localhost:5173, proxies API calls to backend (localhost:8080)</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<p>To run the backend and frontend together, use <code>task dev</code> from the repository root.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"contributing-to-code\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Contributing to Code<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#contributing-to-code\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><h3 id=\"backend-contributions\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Backend Contributions<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#backend-contributions\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h3><ul>\n<li>See our <a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CONTRIBUTING guidelines</a></li>\n<li>Backend uses Spring Boot + Java</li>\n<li>Code formatting: Run <code>./gradlew spotlessApply</code> before committing</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"frontend-contributions-v20\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Frontend Contributions (V2.0+)<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#frontend-contributions-v20\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h3><ul>\n<li>Frontend is a React + TypeScript application</li>\n<li>Uses Vite for build tooling</li>\n<li>UI components: Mantine UI + TailwindCSS</li>\n<li>Adding new tools: See <a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/blob/main/ADDING_TOOLS.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ADDING_TOOLS.md</a></li>\n<li>Tool architecture: Uses <code>useToolOperation</code> hook pattern</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"translation-contributions\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Translation Contributions<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#translation-contributions\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><h3 id=\"translations-toml\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Translations (TOML)<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#translations-toml\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h3><p>Translation files are located at <code>frontend/editor/public/locales/&lt;lang&gt;/translation.toml</code></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>CRITICAL</strong>: Only edit <code>en-US/translation.toml</code>. <code>en-US</code> is the source/primary locale and the i18n fallback (<code>fallbackLng: &quot;en-US&quot;</code>); other languages are managed separately.</li>\n<li>Each locale is a single TOML file (<code>translation.toml</code>), keyed by feature/tool.</li>\n<li>For counts, use i18next plural suffixes on the key (<code>_one</code>, <code>_other</code>, and <code>_zero</code> where needed), for example <code>opCount_one</code>/<code>opCount_other</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"development-resources\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Development Resources<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#development-resources\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><ul>\n<li><strong>API Documentation</strong>: Access at <code>/swagger-ui/index.html</code> on your local instance</li>\n<li><strong>Developer Guide</strong>: See <code>DeveloperGuide.md</code> in the repository</li>\n<li><strong>Claude Code Guide</strong>: See <code>CLAUDE.md</code> for detailed architecture and patterns</li>\n</ul>\n\n    <div class=\"doc-source\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-Tools.github.io/edit/main/docs/Contribute.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M17 3a2.83 2.83 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5L17 3z\"/></svg>\n        Edit this page on GitHub\n      </a>\n    </div>","toc":"<div class=\"toc-title\">On this page</div><ul><li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#development-setup\">Development Setup</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l3\"><a href=\"#prerequisites\">Prerequisites</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l3\"><a href=\"#getting-started\">Getting Started</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#contributing-to-code\">Contributing to Code</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l3\"><a href=\"#backend-contributions\">Backend Contributions</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l3\"><a href=\"#frontend-contributions-v20\">Frontend Contributions (V2.0+)</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#translation-contributions\">Translation Contributions</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l3\"><a href=\"#translations-toml\">Translations (TOML)</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#development-resources\">Development Resources</a></li></ul>","pager":"<a class=\"pager-link pager-prev\" href=\"/FAQ/\">\n        <span class=\"pager-dir\">&larr; Previous</span>\n        <span class=\"pager-title\">FAQ</span>\n      </a><a class=\"pager-link pager-next\" href=\"/analytics-telemetry/\">\n        <span class=\"pager-dir\">Next &rarr;</span>\n        <span class=\"pager-title\">Analytics and Telemetry</span>\n      </a>"}